Nick is relocating to Brisbane for work (as of 2026-07-08). He owns Unit 101/40 Pakington St, St Kilda (bought Sep-Oct 2024, ~$57k purchase costs, ANZ loan ~$3,185/mo repayments, ~$48.5k in offsets). Recommendation delivered 2026-07-08: lease it out rather than sell, treating it as a 2-3 year option under the CGT 6-year absence rule (full exemption preserved to ~2032 if he rents in Brisbane); true after-tax holding cost ~$5.5-6.3k/yr vs his -$14,348 cashflow headline; breakeven growth ~1.5% p.a. Open inputs he owes: loan balance/rate/P&I status from ANZ, market valuation (also locks the CGT cost base at first-rent date), building construction year (pre/post-1987 for depreciation), Brisbane rent-vs-buy intent. Full ISA: PAI/MEMORY/WORK/20260708-155609_lease-vs-sell-apartment/ISA.md.

**Update 2026-07-13 (PM selection):** Property manager comparison completed 2026-07-09. Belle Property (Brodie McPhie, BDM) and Gary Peer (Harry Lustig, Team Leader & Senior PM, 0412 320 302) both quoted 6.6% incl GST management for 101/40 Pakington St; appraisals $680-750 and $700-750/wk (advertise $750, budget $700-720; last leased $440/wk in 2022). Belle fee traps: $220 renewal, $300/10% insurance-claim fee, 10% project mgmt on >$5k works, 0.5wk condition-report penalty. Gary Peer: renewal waived, dearer letting (3% annual), named senior PM up front. Counter-offer drafted (6% incl GST all-in, 1wk letting, renewal waived, traps struck, 30-day termination); decision rule: Belle only if they name a tenured PM (<150 portfolio) and match, else Gary Peer with Harry confirmed as day-to-day PM. Full analysis: PAI/MEMORY/WORK/st-kilda-pm-selection/REPORT.md.

**Update 2026-07-15 (PM decided + insurance):** Nick confirmed **Belle Property** as managing agent. Landlord insurance research done (PAI/MEMORY/WORK/landlord-insurance-st-kilda/ISA.md): OC covers building + $20M common-property liability; Nick needs a contents-only landlord policy (carpets/blinds/appliances, in-lot liability, loss of rent, rent default, tenant damage). Live EBM RentCover Ultra quote pulled 2026-07-15: **$380.00/yr** ($70k contents, 6wk rent default, 52wk loss of rent, $30M liability; postcode 3182, $720/wk, unfurnished, professionally managed; saved quote https://www.rentcover.com.au/get-a-quote/?qid=zrl67xdluwq). Building confirmed built 2016 ("Leroy", 102 lots, Artisan Architects). Nick directive mid-task: no form submission by agents — collect information only. Note: Belle charges $300 or 10% for managing insurance claims (fee trap from PM comparison) — relevant when choosing who lodges claims.

**Why:** major life/finance decision in flight; future sessions on Brisbane, the apartment, or his finances need this baseline.
**How to apply:** if he buys a Brisbane PPOR the CGT exemption must be apportioned between dwellings (election at sale time); revisit the hold decision at the 2-year mark or before the 6-year window closes. Related: [[project-virgin-australia-pipeline]] (the likely Brisbane employer thread).
